/target
.don
*.local.toml
web/node_modules
# The built bundle is a build artifact, not source. It's embedded into the
# binary and shipped in the published crate (Cargo.toml `include` puts it in
# the tarball regardless of this file), but it never belongs in git history.
# build.rs creates the directory when it's missing, so a fresh clone compiles.
web/dist/

# Byte-compiled TUI drivers. Running the drivers is part of the documented
# workflow for any TUI change, so a tracked cache means every such change
# arrives with a binary diff attached.
tools/__pycache__/
